      "label": "Diffusivities from tortuosities",
      "native_category": "",
      "description": "Diffusivities from tortuosities\nOwner: FZJ IET 3:Ying Sun\nTask: T1.4\nMaturity: established method\nDocumentation: Relies on well-known (binary, or effective Fick) diffusion coefficients for the gas composition of interest, and the analytical expression:D_eff = D_free * porosity/tortuosity\nRange of validity or processability: \nIf we think of \"tortuosity\" to be defined according to this method, it is valid by definition.Some care needed to avoid inconsistent usage (regarding channel-land effects, merging layer properties, gas composition, neglect of Knudsen or other effects such as Pt-near contributions)\ninternal key: Diffusivities from tortuosities0",
